--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e32d70991a71c9649876788061c5a6cd, type: 3}
  m_Name: Chapter 0 - 6 (2)
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryScene
  hasChapterIntro: 0
  chapterNumber: Chapter 0 - 6
  chapterName: Caretaker, Kan Section
  hasBattleScene: 0
  battleSceneName: 
  loadMap: 1
  sentences:
  - text: "So this is the Kan Section\u2026 there's a lot of rivers flowing around,
      and a handful of ponds. It's honestly quite relaxing\u2026 "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Assistant Head Caretaker
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos: 2
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -4080215019528799530, guid: 96e4f96bdd6a53347b84a2a1642bbe73, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 3
    characterSprite3: {fileID: -4777918531010614747, guid: 34ee96cfd07cb8446ae90d1d480e3754, type: 3}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: 'Hello, I''m He Xiangu, in charge of the Kan Section. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f576f528c4b3bde4bb74304fedec25d1, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Caretaker, Kan Section
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos: 2
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -13727646140109958, guid: 387198f631716ed4b8adf6586a47d327, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 3
    characterSprite3: {fileID: -5206761803832305590, guid: 8ea384a28134a4640a5836ccbd70faaf, type: 3}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: "Hiya, I'm Han Xiangzi, apparently Lu Dongbin's helper now\u2026 "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Assistant Head Caretaker
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos: 2
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -4080215019528799530, guid: 96e4f96bdd6a53347b84a2a1642bbe73, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 3
    characterSprite3: {fileID: -4777918531010614747, guid: 34ee96cfd07cb8446ae90d1d480e3754, type: 3}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: 'Y-yes, Head Caretaker Lu told me all about it. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f576f528c4b3bde4bb74304fedec25d1, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Caretaker, Kan Section
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos: 4
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -13727646140109958, guid: 387198f631716ed4b8adf6586a47d327, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 3
    characterSprite3: {fileID: -5206761803832305590, guid: 8ea384a28134a4640a5836ccbd70faaf, type: 3}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: 'Head Caretaker Lu has also informed me that another invitation has been
      sent out, a special one this time around. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f576f528c4b3bde4bb74304fedec25d1, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Caretaker, Kan Section
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos: 3
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -13727646140109958, guid: 387198f631716ed4b8adf6586a47d327, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 3
    characterSprite3: {fileID: -5206761803832305590, guid: 8ea384a28134a4640a5836ccbd70faaf, type: 3}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: "\u2026and what exactly makes this one so special? "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Assistant Head Caretaker
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos: 4
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -4080215019528799530, guid: 96e4f96bdd6a53347b84a2a1642bbe73, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 3
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 1606658783463881559, guid: 40727bcd591a05448acb2f6861bb4f08, type: 3}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: 'This invitation has been forcefully taken from the previously planned
      guest. It seems to be someone seeking out an invitation to the Garden, so it
      is special in the way that we will be dealing with someone who apparently knows
      more than the average civilian on how the Garden works. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f576f528c4b3bde4bb74304fedec25d1, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Caretaker, Kan Section
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos: 2
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -13727646140109958, guid: 387198f631716ed4b8adf6586a47d327, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 3
    characterSprite3: {fileID: -1787240519333269993, guid: f2a495eec40429f46add8d4fb61e5091, type: 3}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: "\u2026huh, I never really thought about what would happen if the invitation
      got in the hands of someone other than the intended guest. Do you think the
      Garden accounts for that in its 'fated encounters' thingymajiggy? "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Assistant Head Caretaker
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos: 2
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -4080215019528799530, guid: 96e4f96bdd6a53347b84a2a1642bbe73, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 3
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 1606658783463881559, guid: 40727bcd591a05448acb2f6861bb4f08, type: 3}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: 'I doubt that the Garden never considered that possibility. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f576f528c4b3bde4bb74304fedec25d1, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Caretaker, Kan Section
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos: 2
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -13727646140109958, guid: 387198f631716ed4b8adf6586a47d327, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 3
    characterSprite3: {fileID: -1787240519333269993, guid: f2a495eec40429f46add8d4fb61e5091, type: 3}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: 'In any case, let us go receive this mysterious guest. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f576f528c4b3bde4bb74304fedec25d1, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Caretaker, Kan Section
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos: 2
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -13727646140109958, guid: 387198f631716ed4b8adf6586a47d327, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 3
    characterSprite3: {fileID: -1787240519333269993, guid: f2a495eec40429f46add8d4fb61e5091, type: 3}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: "Greetings, dear guest\u2026 welcome to the Garden. I am Han Xiangzi, Assistant
      Head Caretaker of my role's namesake. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Assistant Head Caretaker
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos: 2
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -4080215019528799530, guid: 96e4f96bdd6a53347b84a2a1642bbe73, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 3
    characterSprite3: {fileID: -6220859904223034604, guid: 45b4fc3fbd6830b4c8b48bb341d3352b, type: 3}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: 'You may find what you''re looking for, but you may also forfeit your precious
      possessions to us. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Assistant Head Caretaker
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos: 2
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -4080215019528799530, guid: 96e4f96bdd6a53347b84a2a1642bbe73, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 3
    characterSprite3: {fileID: -6220859904223034604, guid: 45b4fc3fbd6830b4c8b48bb341d3352b, type: 3}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: 'Dear guest, it seems you''re looking for something specific, something
      close to you. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f576f528c4b3bde4bb74304fedec25d1, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Caretaker, Kan Section
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos: 2
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -13727646140109958, guid: 387198f631716ed4b8adf6586a47d327, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 3
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 7583987884068822478, guid: 1c0c927b75d008546aa7cb87a3af1664, type: 3}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: 'P-please, tell us what you''re- '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f576f528c4b3bde4bb74304fedec25d1, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Caretaker, Kan Section
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos: 2
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -13727646140109958, guid: 387198f631716ed4b8adf6586a47d327, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 3
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 7583987884068822478, guid: 1c0c927b75d008546aa7cb87a3af1664, type: 3}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: "I'm looking\u2026 for my daughter."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2fcdb93d23c559947a72cbf3c8aa97c1, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Invitation Usurper
    characterSprite: {fileID: -4621930804595893795, guid: 62ddd7b7a8a5c9a4b8af6e371c28fbfa, type: 3}
    characterPos: 1
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -4080215019528799530, guid: 96e4f96bdd6a53347b84a2a1642bbe73, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 3
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 7583987884068822478, guid: 1c0c927b75d008546aa7cb87a3af1664, type: 3}
    characterPos3: 0
  backgroud: {fileID: -2889761728585982002, guid: dde821efbab0ba74195bb14d40e3d0b2, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 0}
